1. Sockseek (separate program, not a dependency)
------------------------------------------------

  Sockseek 3.0.5                AGPL-3.0
  https://github.com/fiso64/sockseek

  NeonSeek starts Sockseek as a separate process and contains none of its
  code. The binary is not part of this repository. scripts/fetch_sockseek.ps1
  downloads the pinned release (version and sha256 in
  scripts/sockseek-pin.json) together with its LICENSE file and writes
  vendor/sockseek/SOURCE.txt, which points to the source code of exactly
  that version. The installer ships the same LICENSE and SOURCE.txt next to
  sockseek.exe (in _internal\vendor\sockseek of the installed program).


